        <footnote id="F6">On January 22, 2026, the Reporting Person was granted 35,272 RSUs. Subject to the terms and conditions of the underlying award agreement, 1/12th of the RSUs vest on a quarterly basis beginning on February 3, 2026 (or, to the extent it is not a trading day, the first trading day thereafter).</footnote>
